  "source": "Headless demo of ps_field F1b: winter wheat with a fertiliser plan - cattle slurry (trailing hose) early in spring, two CAN dressings (about 150 kg N/ha in total with the slurry's ammonium), DAP and MOP before sowing, lime every fourth year; test-only operations, not an agronomic recommendation."
